      "body": "Fixes #6626.\n\n`WorldClient::manifest_state` read the `world_state` reply's `seed` with a bare `as_u64()` while `schedules` in the same reply was decoded strictly: a present-but-mistyped seed (`\"42\"`, `-1`, `1.5`, `{}`, `[]`, `true`, `null`) silently became `None` — indistinguishable from the one legitimate `None` (absent seed on a capability-only read, #240) — and the manifest-capture consumer (`commands/world.rs`) bakes that `None` in as seed 0.\n\n- Reply handling factored into `parse_world_state_reply` (mirroring `parse_caps_reply` from #6624): absent seed → `None`; present seed must be a `u64`, else the read fails with `host sent a malformed seed`; `schedules` keeps its strict decode; refusal frames still surface the host's message.\n- No host-side or #240 seed-hiding change.\n- Regression test `world_state_reply_requires_a_u64_seed_when_present` drives the parser with: numeric seed control, absent-seed control, every mistyped shape, a mistyped `schedules` map, and the refusal path.\n\nVerified on laptop (clean worktree from `b7d16d10a1`): `cargo test --lib world_state_reply` passes; full `world_net` module suite 29/29 passes.\n\nFiled/fixed in fallback mode (queue backend down) by lane code-r.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796612948&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=6714&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F6714&signature=2488944beb60a812d77f7fd951d1fa8f078a9b0bb6f90571774b03d6d91ddbaf\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/6714?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
